<div class="container">
  <h1 class="text mb-3" style="font-weight: bold">Get Started with Cat Feeding Tracker V2 🐾</h1>
  <h2 class="text mb-5">Welcome to the Cat Feeding Tracker V2! Follow these simple steps to begin monitoring your cats' 😸 eating habits and gain valuable insights.</h2>

    <h3 class="text", style="color: #515a5a; font-weight: bold">Step 1: Access the Application </h4>
      <h4 class="text mb-5", style="color: #919097; font-weight: bold">Open your web browser and navigate to the app's home page: <a class="link-secondary" href=https://feeding-tracker-v2-3e86df55d613.herokuapp.com/home target="_blank">Cat Feeding Tracker V2</a> </h5>
    <h3 class="text", style="color: #515a5a; font-weight: bold">Step 2: Sign Up or Log In </h3>
      <h4 class="text mb-4", style="color: #919097; font-weight: bold">To start tracking, you'll need an account.</h4>
        <h5 class="text", style="color: #6c6d70; font-weight: bold">New Users: Look for a "Sign Up" button/link on navigation bar.
        Click it and follow the prompts to register a new account. This typically involves providing an email address and creating a password. Your time zone will likely be set during this process. </h5>
        <div class="d-flex justify-content-center mb-5">
          <%= image_tag("signup.png", width:"1200px", alt: "Chart of tracking", class: "rounded-4 shadow-lg")%>
        </div>

        <h5 class="text", style="color: #6c6d70; font-weight: bold">Existing Users: Click on the "Log In" button/link.
        Enter your registered username and password to access your dashboard.</h5>
        <div class="d-flex justify-content-center mb-5">
          <%= image_tag("signin.png", width:"1200px", alt: "Chart of tracking", class: "rounded-4 shadow-lg")%>
        </div>
    <h3 class="text", style="color: #515a5a; font-weight: bold">Step 3: Add Your First Pet</h3>
      <h5 class="text mb-3", style="color: #919097; font-weight: bold">Once logged in, the first thing you might want to do is add your cat's profile or You can skip it and add the cat's profile later. 
      The app supports tracking for multiple cats.</h5>

      <h5 class="text mb-4", style="color: #919097; font-weight: bold">On your dashboard or home screen, look for an dropdown "Profile 'your registered username'", first item "Add Pet".
      Click on it and enter the necessary details for your cat (e.g., name, birthday, gender, breed, wight....). Save the pet's profile. <h5>
    <h3 class="text", style="color: #515a5a; font-weight: bold">Step 4: Log Your First Feeding </h4>
      <h5 class="text mb-3", style="color: #919097; font-weight: bold">While your cats' profile set up, you're ready to log their first meal. </h5>

      <h5 class="text mb-3", style="color: #919097; font-weight: bold">Navigate to your pet's individual tracking page (look for a dropdown "Tracker Records" and select the cat's name's record, it will lead you to the cat's record).
       <h5 class="text mb-2", style="color: #6c6d70; font-weight: bold">Automatic Date & Time: Notice that the date and time will likely be pre-filled for you.</h6>
       <h5 class="text mb-2", style="color: #6c6d70; font-weight: bold">Enter Feeding Details: </h6>
       <h5 class="text mb-4", style="color: #6c6d70; font-weight: bold">Input the amount of food given. If applicable, enter the time of the cat come back to eat the food, 
       therefore, you have to set up a camera near the spot where the food put.</h6>
      <h4 class="text mb-4", style="color: #919097; font-weight: bold">  (Visual Reminder!) Pay attention to any visual cues:</h4>
       <h5 class="text", style="color: #6c6d70; font-weight: bold">A red background might indicate you need to fill out the "left amount." </h5>
       <h5 class="text", style="color: #6c6d70; font-weight: bold">A yellow background might prompt you to enter the "time of come back to eat."</h5>
      <h4 class="text mb-4", style="color: #919097; font-weight: bold">Save: Click "Save" or "Add Feeding" to record the entry.</h4>

    <h3 class="text", style="color: #515a5a; font-weight: bold"> Step 5: Explore & Track! </h3>
      <h4 class="text mb-4", style="color: #919097; font-weight: bold">You've successfully logged your first feeding! Now you can: Continue adding more feeding entries.</h4>
      <h4 class="text mb-4", style="color: #919097; font-weight: bold">Explore the charts to see your cat's eating patterns and amount trend over time. </h4>
    <h3 class="text", style="color: #515a5a; font-weight: bold"> You can add more pets if you have them. </h3>
    <h3 class="text mb-5", style="color: #515a5a; font-weight: bold">Manage your existing feeding records, pet profiles, or user information by using the "Edit" and "Delete" options. </h3>
  <h2 class="text mb-5", style="font-weight: bold">Enjoy tracking your cat's journey to better health and diet management! 🐾🐾</h2>
</div>